      "updated": 1788652800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Problem: “forget my INR 6,000 budget”\nrelearns the budget.\nApproach: private current source + held job;\nresolve controls; release surviving text only.\nTest: no new eligible copy from the forget\nrequest.",
      "originalText": "Problem: “forget my INR 6,000 budget”\nrelearns the budget.\nApproach: private current source + held job;\nresolve controls; release surviving text only.\nTest: no new eligible copy from the forget\nrequest.",
