      "text": "Source: ARCHITECTURE.md §§5–8, 10–11. These guarantees still need actual backend, concurrency, recovery and model tests.",
      "originalText": "Source: ARCHITECTURE.md §§5–8, 10–11. These guarantees still need actual backend, concurrency, recovery and model tests.",
